* FUNCTION     THE FUNCTION OF THE REAL-TIME TELEMETRY DELAY UTILITY
*              ROUTINE IS TO DELAY THE PROPER TIME BETWEEN TELEMETRY
*              ITEMS, AND TO SET THE MODE REGISTER TO THE PROPER
*              SETTING.

* ENTRY        U.TR00

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
       BLOCK   18

U.TR00 STO     777          SAVE RETURN LINKAGE
TR10   MPY     =1           INHIBIT INTERRUPTS                        B
       PIO     103          READ REAL TIME CLOCK                      I
       SUB     D.VTD        COMPARE AGAINST LAST TELM TIME
       AND     D.KSY0       MASK 13 L.O. BITS
       SUB     D.KTD        REQUIRED TELM DALAY
       MPY     =1
       TMI     TR20         SUFFICIENT DELAY FOR TELEMETRY            N
       PIO     103
       ADD     =(P.TIBS)
       ADD     D.KZRO

       MPY     =1
       STO     D.VTD        UPDATE TELEMETRY TIME                     B
       HOP     777          RETURN                                    X


TR20   ADD     D.KZRO       DELAY FOR TELEMETRY                       B
       ADD     D.KZRO
       ADD     D.KZRO
       TRA     TR10                                                   G
